            <li>They ______ to Lahore tomorrow. <br> <span class="text-slate-500">(a) will go (b) goes (c) went (d) going</span></li>
            <li>______ you help me, please? <br> <span class="text-slate-500">(a) Can (b) Has (c) Is (d) Was</span></li>
          </ul>

